%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Joiningthecumpanions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852550
    - rid: 9079475250346852551
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, head up to the market, then take a left...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852552
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Once you see the big tree, take a right...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852553
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well that looks like an upside-down boat to me!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852554
    - rid: 9079475250346852555
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852556
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Natsuki enters, she encounters two people who have just begun brawling.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852557
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The other people in the room get up, but instead of intervening they
      start giving advice.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What kind of frat-bro group have I just signed myself up for...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852558
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Despite having second thoughts, Natsuki looks around for stairs to a
      lower level.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852559
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: She spots them ahead of her, toward her right; which she promptly desceneds.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852560
    - rid: 9079475250346852562
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Natsuki walks towards the end of the hallway, she finds two men in
      conversation...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: But I still hear the call of the blood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852563
    - rid: 9079475250346852564
    - rid: 9079475250346852566
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: We all do. It is our burden to bear. But we can overcome.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: You have my brother and I, obviously. But I don't know if the rest will
      go along quite so easily.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Leave that to me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The elder of the two turns toward Natsuki.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: And what do you want, young lass?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm here to join the Companions.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852572
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: That right? Let me get a better look at you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Kodlak does exactly what he said he would: he takes a better look at
      Natsuki.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852573
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (This old guy's starin' at me like a total creep...!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. Perhaps... you do seem to have a certain strength of spirit...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852574
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Master, you cannot be serious; just look at her scrawny limbs!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852575
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: I am nobody's master, Vilkas. And last I checked, Jorrvaskr always has
      room for those with a fire burning in their hearts.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852576
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Apologies, but perhaps this isn't the time. I've never even heard of
      this outsider.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230387
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Sometimes the famous come to us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230388
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Sometimes the men and women come to us to seek their fame.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: It makes no difference; what matters is their heart.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> their arm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course. How are you in battle, girl?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki takes a moment to think of how best to put her complete and utter
      lack of experience.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230389
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I helped defeat the dragon at the Western Watchtower yesterday-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230390
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I think I can handle myself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230391
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Helped slay a dragon, hm?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230392
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, Vilkas here will decide how much you actually contributed to that
      feat.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Vilkas, take her out to the yard and see what she can do.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Follow me, whelp.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Whelp-?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230393
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230394
    - rid: 9079475269545230395
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, show me what you're made of!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267813221466169
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475269545230396
    - rid: 9079475269545230397
    - rid: 9079475269545230398
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: That's enough.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267813221466192
    - rid: 4351267813221466193
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267813221466194
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm still not <i>entirely</i> sure what the old man saw in you, but I
      can respect his judgements after clashing blades with you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267813221466198
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (You friggin' better...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267813221466199
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: But! You're still a whelp around here, lass.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267813221466200
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
